    "CoiStatement": "Disclosure MAR and CFDVL work for Productos Medix, S.A de C.V., which is a pharmaceutical company that sells mazindol as an anorectic in Mexico. However, Productos Medix, S.A de C.V. were not involved in the recollection and analysis of data. The authors report no conflicts of interest in this work.",
